ime that we see  his suit eventually the authorities get  Bucky Captain America and Black Panther  and the fight is stopped  of course they break out and the rest of  the movie is about the war between the  division of the Avengers and about black  panther finding Bucky to kill him at the  end of the movie Black Panther finds out  that it was actually Baron Zemo that  killed his father and not Bucky and he  actually takes Bucky back to Wakanda so  he can go back into stasis for a while  so that's a brief recap of what  happen in civil war let's now talk about  some awesome facts about black panther  himself for starters black panther is  not only the name of the character  created it is also a title that is held  by the king of Wakanda that has to be  earned by going through a series of  trials once earned  T'Challa becomes the king of Wakanda and  the black panther and gets the partake  of the heart-shaped herb which gives him  superhuman abilities such as increased  speed reflexes senses and healing if it  wasn't enough that the heart-shape herb  enhanced his abilities T'Challa was  already a very skilled fighter having  mastered several forms of martial arts  he has mastered several forms of unarmed  combat and being from Wakanda a warrior  race he is also a master of armed combat  enabling him to use many different  weapons on top of being exceptionally  skilled in combat he is a master  strategist as well  he thinks five steps ahead of what he  does he is a brilliant tracker tactician  and planner if all of these weren't  enough to make Black Panther a deadly  force to be reckoned with  he's also a genius T'Challa was educated  by the finest schools in Europe and the  US and has many degrees including  physics to top it all off black panther  suit is one of the most impressive in  the MCU it is made out of vibranium  vibranium is a rare naturally-occurring  meteoric metal with energy manipulating  qualities it is most commonly known for  being what Captain America showed is  made out of so think of the material  that Captain America's shield is made  out of and imagine a suit made out of it  that's what the Black Panther suit is  his suit enables him to withstand  devastating attacks and take bullet  damage with no effect we see several  times in civil war and the trailers for  Black Panther as well as many times when  bullets hit Captain America shield that  bullets don't bounce off vibranium they  just come to a complete stop due to the  vibranium absorbing the kinetic energy  the suit actually has vibranium on the  bottom of the suits boots as well which  create force fields and his soles this  lets T'Challa fall from extremely high  Heights lets him run on water and even  lets him run up walls with enough  momentum he can also use the boots for  attacking and defending the suit can  change its appearance to resemble normal  clothes when he's in public making it to  where he can always wear the suit and to  end it all the suit has energy daggers  that Black Panther can use and the suit  regenerates them allowing him to never  run out as you can see black panther is  packed with a ton of abilities and it's  going to be a super awesome movie to  watch and see how the story unfolds this  is everything you need to know going  into Black Panther it looks like it's  gonna be an amazing movie and it comes  out February 16th let me know if you go  see it and what your thoughts are by  dropping a like and a comment below and  be sure to subscribe to my channel for  everything Black Panther marvel at all  things superhero thank you so much for  watching and have a great day
 

